# Keep the published sdist lean: setuptools' legacy default auto-includes
# tests/test*.py. Drop the test tree — it isn't needed to build or run the
# package (the wheel ships only perforce_alm_mcp.py), and the bundled tests
# wouldn't run from the sdist anyway since conftest.py / _test_helpers.py
# (root-level, not matched by the test*.py glob) are not included.
prune tests
